WEBVTT

01:30.330 --> 01:34.970
[The Heir]

01:35.460 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 39]

01:42.310 --> 01:43.150
Luo Wenqian.

01:44.310 --> 01:45.710
Turn around and take one last look.

01:45.710 --> 01:46.640
You won't be back

01:46.759 --> 01:48.120
for another 20 years.

03:32.530 --> 03:34.860
Zhen, you're finally back.

03:35.030 --> 03:36.360
Eldest Aunt, what's wrong?

03:36.360 --> 03:37.960
Qiu'e is about to give birth.

03:38.329 --> 03:39.329
Let's hurry over.

03:52.760 --> 03:54.520
Mother, how is she?

03:55.750 --> 03:57.840
The midwife said the fetal position
and term are both fine.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.700
But why hasn't she delivered yet?

04:00.800 --> 04:02.150
Childbirth can be fast or slow.

04:02.150 --> 04:03.190
Why so anxious?

04:03.560 --> 04:04.680
Back when I gave birth to you,

04:04.680 --> 04:06.400
it took a full 8 to 10 hours.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.560
But this is too long.

04:17.480 --> 04:18.240
She's delivered.

04:18.240 --> 04:19.240
She's delivered.

04:20.829 --> 04:21.390
Grandpa.

04:21.390 --> 04:22.720
She's delivered!

04:22.720 --> 04:23.630
Both mother and son are safe.

04:23.630 --> 04:25.290
Congratulations, everyone!

04:25.360 --> 04:26.560
Thank you. Thank you.

04:29.920 --> 04:30.800
Jin.

04:31.720 --> 04:33.730
It's a happy occasion. Don't cry.

04:34.210 --> 04:35.610
The baby's finally born.

04:40.120 --> 04:41.159
Who am I?

04:47.260 --> 04:49.330
The baby actually stopped crying

04:49.360 --> 04:50.620
as soon as you held him.

04:52.120 --> 04:53.920
This is my own nephew, after all.

04:53.950 --> 04:55.120
He recognizes me.

04:57.950 --> 04:59.040
Right?

05:00.720 --> 05:03.800
After all these hardships, our Li family

05:04.360 --> 05:06.090
is finally seeing better days.

05:07.800 --> 05:10.360
This baby really came
at just the right time.

05:11.160 --> 05:12.000
Qiu'e.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.480
Have you and Zhengliang decided

05:14.510 --> 05:16.230
on a name for him?

05:16.920 --> 05:18.780
We chatted about it a few days ago.

05:19.510 --> 05:20.630
I was thinking,

05:21.040 --> 05:24.070
now that our family's embracing
a whole new beginning,

05:24.070 --> 05:25.270
we planned to name him

05:25.600 --> 05:26.720
Li Tianxin.

05:27.430 --> 05:28.600
Li Tianxin.

05:31.190 --> 05:32.270
Wonderful name.

06:06.630 --> 06:08.490
Aren't you going in to take a look?

06:18.750 --> 06:19.560
Grandpa.

06:20.830 --> 06:22.190
Over the past few days,

06:22.800 --> 06:25.750
I feel like I've lived through
my whole life.

06:30.870 --> 06:32.310
Then tell me—

06:33.750 --> 06:35.159
what does it feel like,

06:36.310 --> 06:38.440
having lived through your whole life?

06:39.430 --> 06:41.230
Sweet, sour, bitter, and spicy—

06:42.040 --> 06:43.240
everything is there,

06:44.040 --> 06:45.770
but it's constantly changing.

06:47.159 --> 06:50.159
It really makes one sigh
at how unpredictable life is.

06:53.630 --> 06:54.560
Scared?

06:58.560 --> 06:59.159
I am.

07:01.600 --> 07:03.460
But I have to keep moving forward.

07:07.560 --> 07:08.510
Yes.

07:12.070 --> 07:13.560
We can only move forward,

07:15.200 --> 07:17.000
and we have no choice but to.

07:19.160 --> 07:20.120
I

07:21.040 --> 07:22.800
will also try my best to live on

07:26.160 --> 07:27.620
and move forward with you.

07:44.190 --> 07:45.000
Grandpa.

07:46.390 --> 07:48.630
Look, the snow's getting
heavier and heavier.

07:48.630 --> 07:50.070
By tomorrow morning,

07:50.920 --> 07:52.980
everything will be covered in white.

07:59.480 --> 08:04.720
I haven't seen such heavy snow
in a long time.

08:24.290 --> 08:32.559
[3 Years Later, the First Year
of the Longqing Era]

08:35.080 --> 08:36.390
Ancestors above,

08:37.549 --> 08:39.549
in this season of abundant harvest,

08:40.320 --> 08:41.600
our family is well

08:42.789 --> 08:44.720
and all matters proceed smoothly.

08:45.030 --> 08:47.230
I hereby report this to you, ancestors,

08:47.870 --> 08:49.730
and share this blessing with you.

09:11.390 --> 09:12.120
Mother.

09:14.300 --> 09:15.810
I miss you dearly.

09:18.480 --> 09:20.340
Everything has been well at home.

09:22.320 --> 09:24.580
The new emperor has
ascended the throne,

09:25.200 --> 09:28.330
and the date for the tribute selection
has been moved up.

09:28.360 --> 09:29.030
Mother,

09:31.120 --> 09:32.960
please bless Zhen.

09:33.600 --> 09:35.120
May she lead our Li Ink

09:34.980 --> 09:39.110
[Spirit Tablet of Lady Wang, Rujun]

09:36.140 --> 09:39.140
to win the "Champion of Ink Making" plaque
once again.

09:48.910 --> 09:50.960
Great-aunt!

09:51.480 --> 09:52.480
Be careful.

09:52.510 --> 09:54.200
Why are you here?

09:54.270 --> 09:57.030
Mother asked me to call you home
to "eat daylight."

09:54.700 --> 09:56.690
[Li Tianxin, Great-Grandson of
the Li Family's Eighth Branch]

09:56.710 --> 09:59.530
["Eating daylight" is an old Huizhou
dialect term for having breakfast]

09:57.550 --> 09:58.390
Look at him.

09:58.390 --> 10:00.910
He insisted on coming to find you,
making quite a fuss about it.

10:00.910 --> 10:03.150
You came to pick me up to "eat daylight",

10:03.150 --> 10:04.030
right?

10:04.840 --> 10:05.840
Let's go home.

10:05.840 --> 10:06.300
Come on.

10:06.320 --> 10:07.840
Have you eaten?

10:07.910 --> 10:09.360
I haven't.

10:09.720 --> 10:11.000
What did Grandma make?

10:11.670 --> 10:14.120
Grandma made tofu pudding.

10:14.750 --> 10:17.460
Your favorite tofu pudding, right?

10:27.030 --> 10:29.390
Jin, we're here to help you.

10:29.390 --> 10:31.150
Grandma. Grandma.

10:31.170 --> 10:31.690
No need.

10:31.870 --> 10:33.550
We all came to help.

10:33.750 --> 10:35.080
Why did you all come in here?

10:35.080 --> 10:36.080
Just wait to eat.

10:36.080 --> 10:37.670
I can handle this bit of work myself.

10:37.670 --> 10:39.790
Our Jingdong and Zhengshen

10:39.790 --> 10:42.520
run off to the ink workshop
before dawn every day,

10:42.910 --> 10:45.370
and I'm left alone at home
with nothing to do.

10:45.510 --> 10:48.240
Yeah. I thought the return of
the Eighth Branch

10:48.240 --> 10:50.500
would bring some life back to the family.

10:50.840 --> 10:53.030
But in the end, every morning,

10:53.030 --> 10:55.080
it's still just the same few of us.

10:55.790 --> 10:56.670
Exactly.

10:56.840 --> 10:58.770
We definitely can't get Zhen back.

10:58.870 --> 10:59.870
Over the past 3 years,

10:59.870 --> 11:02.670
you could count her days off on one hand.

11:03.360 --> 11:06.200
Ever since our Zhengliang
opened his inkstone shop last year,

11:06.200 --> 11:08.480
he's been so busy he's hardly home,
either.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.510
And Zhengyou.

11:09.670 --> 11:12.390
Zhengyou has gotten completely
hooked on learning ink-making from Zhen.

11:12.390 --> 11:14.850
He goes to the ink workshop
every single day.

11:14.870 --> 11:15.960
This year,

11:16.070 --> 11:18.960
the imperial court's starting
a new round of tribute selection.

11:18.960 --> 11:20.840
My father's condition has just
improved a bit,

11:20.840 --> 11:22.270
and even he has gone to the ink workshop.

11:22.270 --> 11:24.870
Look at that—our whole family
is at the ink workshop.

11:24.870 --> 11:26.440
Our Zhengrun is the same.

11:26.550 --> 11:28.150
He's constantly talking about

11:28.150 --> 11:30.080
how he wants to go to the ink workshop.

11:30.080 --> 11:31.510
Last night in his sleep,

11:31.550 --> 11:33.000
he was even mumbling about it,

11:33.000 --> 11:36.260
something about the soot aging
and collecting it quickly.

11:36.840 --> 11:39.840
Mother, the ink workshop is fun.
I want to go too.

11:39.840 --> 11:40.810
Sure. Sure.

11:41.550 --> 11:43.960
We Huizhou people are just born
to work hard.

11:43.960 --> 11:45.840
No one in our family can escape it.

11:46.870 --> 11:49.360
Doggie, the tofu pudding is ready.

11:50.480 --> 11:50.960
Coming.

11:50.960 --> 11:51.600
Be careful.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.320
Alright.

11:52.510 --> 11:53.870
So, as usual—

11:53.870 --> 11:55.320
one for the inkstone shop,

11:55.320 --> 11:56.270
one for New Li Ink Workshop,

11:56.270 --> 11:57.200
and one for Li Ink Workshop.

11:57.200 --> 11:57.720
That's right.

11:57.720 --> 11:58.270
Alright.

11:58.270 --> 11:59.360
Be careful on the way.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.270
Tell Zhen to eat it while it's still warm.

12:01.270 --> 12:02.730
You can trust me with this.

12:03.750 --> 12:05.480
Here, try some too, everyone.

12:05.480 --> 12:05.960
Come on.

12:06.080 --> 12:06.870
Tianxin, come here.

12:06.870 --> 12:07.750
Tianxin, come quickly.

12:07.750 --> 12:09.350
Come have some tofu pudding.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.580
[Sihe Ink]

12:15.030 --> 12:16.050
Masters.

12:17.030 --> 12:18.870
The new round of Tribute Ink selection

12:18.870 --> 12:21.000
will be held again soon.

12:21.910 --> 12:23.910
The "Champion of Ink Making" plaque
has been out of the Li family's hands

12:23.910 --> 12:25.000
for over 16 years.

12:25.240 --> 12:28.030
This time, it is our best opportunity
to clear our past shame

12:28.030 --> 12:30.030
and restore the glory of Li Ink.

12:30.670 --> 12:31.670
I hereby announce

12:32.030 --> 12:35.030
that the Li family will recreate
our ancestors' Sihe Ink

12:35.030 --> 12:37.690
to take part in the selection
on behalf of Li Ink.

12:38.960 --> 12:39.840
Manager Zhen.

12:40.510 --> 12:44.240
This Sihe Ink is a priceless treasure,
the only one of its kind in the world.

12:44.240 --> 12:46.480
Moreover, restoring it would take
a great deal of time and effort,

12:46.480 --> 12:49.870
and it may not be ready in time
for this year's Tribute Ink selection.

12:49.870 --> 12:50.960
Why don't we...

12:53.390 --> 12:56.190
Why don't we
improve the ancient lacquer-soot ink

12:56.320 --> 12:58.120
and submit it for the selection?

12:58.510 --> 12:59.970
It would be safer that way.

13:00.870 --> 13:02.150
-Indeed.
-Agreed.

13:03.550 --> 13:04.320
Everyone.

13:04.910 --> 13:07.720
Without breaking the old,
nothing new can be established.

13:07.720 --> 13:09.910
If we blindly cling to
what's incomplete and outdated,

13:09.910 --> 13:11.870
we'll only trap ourselves in stagnation.

13:11.870 --> 13:13.440
Only by discarding the old
and bringing forth the new

13:13.440 --> 13:15.080
can we move forward.

13:28.840 --> 13:30.080
Masters.

13:31.840 --> 13:34.170
The Li Ink legacy has lasted
for a century,

13:36.000 --> 13:38.630
and its essence is not in
the physical form of the ink,

13:38.630 --> 13:39.510
but

13:41.440 --> 13:43.840
in the spirit that unites people's hearts.

13:44.960 --> 13:46.160
The so-called "Sihe"

13:46.630 --> 13:48.320
not only refers to the ink itself,

13:48.320 --> 13:50.790
but also to heaven, earth,
and human hearts coming together.

13:50.790 --> 13:55.480
At present, the hearts of everyone
in Li Ink are more united than ever.

13:56.240 --> 13:59.750
This is the best time
to restore the ancient Sihe Ink.

14:01.630 --> 14:02.600
Masters.

14:03.150 --> 14:05.480
Every word Eighth Uncle said makes sense.

14:05.600 --> 14:08.030
I, Li Jingdong, have faith in Zhen.

14:09.120 --> 14:10.980
Let's entrust the future of Li Ink

14:11.440 --> 14:13.200
to Zhen.

14:14.630 --> 14:15.360
Everyone.

14:16.230 --> 14:17.790
My decision today

14:18.120 --> 14:21.000
is meant to bring together
all our strength in the present

14:21.000 --> 14:23.910
to uncover the key techniques
of our ancestors' ink-making.

14:23.910 --> 14:25.120
It is also

14:26.270 --> 14:28.200
to light the way for future generations.

14:28.200 --> 14:30.720
I hope you all can pool your wisdom
and efforts,

14:30.720 --> 14:33.200
and lend a helping hand to our Li Ink.

14:33.360 --> 14:34.160
That's right.

14:34.600 --> 14:36.550
Every time Li Ink has faced difficulties,

14:36.550 --> 14:38.840
it was Manager Zhen
who led us out of them.

14:39.240 --> 14:41.170
So what's there to hesitate about?

14:41.320 --> 14:42.240
Manager Zhen.

14:42.840 --> 14:45.120
We will not fail your trust

14:45.510 --> 14:46.480
and will give it our all.

14:46.480 --> 14:47.240
Yes.

14:47.440 --> 14:48.510
This Sihe Ink

14:48.510 --> 14:50.510
was won back by Manager Zhen.

14:50.790 --> 14:52.120
For the future of Li Ink,

14:52.200 --> 14:53.550
we'll give it our all.

14:53.630 --> 14:56.160
-We'll give it our all!
-We'll give it our all!

16:08.510 --> 16:09.320
Manager Zhen.

16:10.240 --> 16:14.390
Here's the fresh tofu pudding
your mother made today.

16:17.790 --> 16:19.510
Here, eat it while it's still warm.

16:19.510 --> 16:20.870
Okay, just put it here.

16:30.150 --> 16:31.240
That's not right.

16:34.510 --> 16:35.840
Isinglass,

16:36.360 --> 16:37.600
horn glue,

16:42.960 --> 16:44.200
peach resin...

16:45.030 --> 16:46.030
What else?

16:47.250 --> 16:49.480
Manager Zhen, why don't you eat it
while it's still warm?

16:49.480 --> 16:50.610
It'll get cold soon.

16:56.150 --> 16:59.550
Horn glue, isinglass, peach resin..

16:59.790 --> 17:00.990
Wrong, wrong, wrong.

17:01.270 --> 17:02.120
What's wrong?

17:02.200 --> 17:03.530
You got the wrong thing.

17:07.349 --> 17:07.829
I...

17:08.680 --> 17:10.550
I'm truly scatterbrained.

17:10.569 --> 17:12.770
How did I end up rinsing my brush in here?

17:13.200 --> 17:14.790
Then please don't forget
today's family banquet.

17:14.790 --> 17:15.440
It's the first of August.

17:15.440 --> 17:16.400
The first of August?

17:16.400 --> 17:18.030
It's already the first of August?

17:18.030 --> 17:18.880
This is bad. This is bad.

17:18.880 --> 17:19.880
The Literary Association meeting is today.

17:19.880 --> 17:20.640
I have to go immediately.

17:20.640 --> 17:21.829
Manager Zhen, Manager Zhen.

17:21.829 --> 17:22.680
What is it now?

17:22.680 --> 17:23.790
I promised your mother

17:23.790 --> 17:25.250
to make sure you finish it.

17:31.830 --> 17:33.440
Given the situation in this bowl,

17:33.440 --> 17:35.350
I probably can't eat it anymore, right?

17:35.350 --> 17:35.920
Yeah.

17:36.750 --> 17:38.070
Come on. Make way.

17:38.690 --> 17:40.690
Then please don't forget
the family banquet tonight.

17:40.690 --> 17:42.720
Your mother said no one could be missing.

17:42.720 --> 17:43.590
Got it!

17:58.030 --> 17:58.880
My Lady,

17:58.960 --> 18:01.070
it's such a nice day outside,

18:01.070 --> 18:02.270
and these flowers are so beautiful.

18:02.270 --> 18:04.070
Why are you still frowning?

18:04.310 --> 18:06.400
Mr. Li made efforts all over

18:06.400 --> 18:08.200
to gather these flowers for you.

18:08.340 --> 18:09.980
Just because back in Nanjing,

18:09.980 --> 18:11.240
you said that wind orchid

18:11.240 --> 18:13.640
was the best among orchids in your heart—

18:14.070 --> 18:16.310
quiet and serene, growing deep
in the mountains and forests,

18:16.310 --> 18:18.310
yet possessing
a uniquely refined fragrance.

18:18.310 --> 18:19.270
Man.

18:20.920 --> 18:23.320
Check how many leaves
this wind orchid has.

18:25.160 --> 18:27.720
One, two, three,

18:28.030 --> 18:30.590
four, five, six.

18:31.270 --> 18:32.590
Six leaves, My Lady.

18:32.590 --> 18:33.400
What's wrong?

18:34.640 --> 18:38.400
A wind orchid only grows 2 leaves a year.

18:39.720 --> 18:40.680
Six leaves—

18:42.070 --> 18:43.400
it's been 3 years.

18:43.830 --> 18:45.400
Yet not a single moment

18:46.240 --> 18:49.770
in the past 3 years could compare to
the 3 days I spent in Nanjing.

18:50.200 --> 18:51.750
Wait, wait, wait.

18:52.240 --> 18:54.510
All Father does is make me wait
and endure.

18:54.510 --> 18:57.240
I-I've been waiting for 3 whole years!

18:57.350 --> 18:58.400
My Lady...

18:58.820 --> 19:02.280
Why hasn't Li Zhengshen's betrothal gift
been delivered yet?

19:03.640 --> 19:05.310
It's fine to talk like this

19:05.350 --> 19:07.160
at home,

19:07.510 --> 19:08.790
but don't let it spread outside.

19:08.790 --> 19:11.120
If it gets out, you'll be a laughingstock.

19:13.640 --> 19:15.240
Be good and stay at home.

19:15.270 --> 19:17.290
I need to go to the Literary Association

19:17.290 --> 19:19.890
to discuss this year's
Tribute Ink selection.

19:20.520 --> 19:21.960
What does that have to do with me?

19:21.960 --> 19:24.030
It has everything to do with you.

19:24.350 --> 19:25.750
Once the Tribute Ink selection is over,

19:25.750 --> 19:29.680
I'll petition the imperial court
to retire and return to our hometown.

19:32.070 --> 19:33.400
Return to our hometown?

19:33.640 --> 19:36.000
Father, I'm not going anywhere.

19:36.110 --> 19:37.880
This is where Zhengshen's home is.

19:37.880 --> 19:39.080
I... I'm not leaving.

19:40.470 --> 19:42.080
Look at you. Look at you.

19:42.680 --> 19:45.740
A grown daughter cannot
be kept at home forever, right?

19:46.590 --> 19:48.270
Honey, think about it.

19:49.000 --> 19:51.200
If I resign from my position
as the Ink Affairs Official,

19:51.200 --> 19:53.200
then when the Li family comes
to propose marriage,

19:53.200 --> 19:57.200
there won't be any suspicion
of them climbing the social ladder, right?

19:58.200 --> 20:01.680
And once the Tribute Ink is decided
and a new Ink Affairs Official takes office,

20:01.680 --> 20:03.510
at the earliest, you and Zhengshen

20:03.510 --> 20:04.680
could be married next spring.

20:04.680 --> 20:05.790
And then,

20:06.550 --> 20:09.790
-I'll be free to travel and enjoy life.
-Congratulations, My Lady.

20:09.790 --> 20:10.590
Do you really mean it, Father?

20:10.590 --> 20:11.310
Of course.

20:12.510 --> 20:14.000
Well then... Man,

20:14.000 --> 20:15.590
let's go get changed.

20:15.750 --> 20:17.930
We'll go to the Literary Association
with Father.

20:17.930 --> 20:19.110
I'll go tell Zhen.

20:19.440 --> 20:20.480
Alright, alright.

20:20.480 --> 20:20.960
Stop making a fuss.

20:20.960 --> 20:22.440
Stop making a fuss, alright?

20:22.440 --> 20:24.030
Let me finish the important matter first,

20:24.030 --> 20:25.790
then we'll plan things
carefully together, alright?

20:25.790 --> 20:26.850
Alright, alright.

20:30.350 --> 20:32.880
Master, a message came from
the prefectural office

20:32.880 --> 20:34.350
that Eunuch Zhao has arrived in Huizhou.

20:34.350 --> 20:36.070
You're summoned to
receive the imperial edict there.

20:36.070 --> 20:37.720
All the other Hui Ink families have also
headed from the Literary Association

20:37.720 --> 20:40.200
to the prefectural office
to wait for the edict.

20:40.200 --> 20:41.830
Why is there another imperial edict?

20:41.830 --> 20:43.590
Alright. Prepare the sedan chair.
To the prefectural office.

20:43.590 --> 20:44.240
Yes.

20:44.400 --> 20:47.110
Xianglan, I'm going to handle
official business.

20:47.110 --> 20:48.070
Take care, Father.

20:48.070 --> 20:48.480
Okay.

20:48.550 --> 20:49.680
I'll be waiting!

20:53.830 --> 20:54.590
Everyone.

20:54.920 --> 20:56.240
With the accession of the new emperor,

20:56.240 --> 20:59.000
the Tribute Ink selection
is about to begin.

20:59.560 --> 21:03.350
Today, Eunuch Zhao has come in person
to deliver an imperial decree,

21:03.350 --> 21:08.720
which shows just how highly His Majesty
regards this year's tribute selection.

21:10.720 --> 21:14.110
Three years ago, Li Ink exercised
the tribute ink contract on our behalf.

21:14.110 --> 21:15.640
After Qing He's downfall,

21:15.920 --> 21:16.980
the imperial court

21:17.350 --> 21:19.750
also restored the Chen family's good name.

21:20.750 --> 21:21.790
Manager Zhen.

21:23.590 --> 21:24.650
Third Master Chen.

21:25.480 --> 21:27.400
Li Ink and Chen Ink

21:27.830 --> 21:31.680
are now the pillars
of Huizhou's ink industry.

21:32.680 --> 21:36.200
In this year's tribute selection,
your two families will face off.

21:36.200 --> 21:37.550
We are all

21:38.110 --> 21:39.440
looking forward to it.

21:40.960 --> 21:43.490
President Hu, that's not the way
to look at it.

21:43.490 --> 21:45.220
Great talents often reveal themselves
at a young age.

21:45.220 --> 21:47.280
Word has it that Ruogu secluded himself
for 3 years

21:47.280 --> 21:50.680
and created an ink pellet
that dissolves instantly in water.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.770
Third Grandfather.

21:52.880 --> 21:55.160
We can't just sit back and do nothing.

21:57.240 --> 22:01.160
Kid, do you dare to compete with me?

22:02.830 --> 22:03.720
Third Grandfather.

22:03.720 --> 22:05.830
Please don't go easy on me then.

22:06.000 --> 22:08.130
The youth of today are something else.

22:09.720 --> 22:12.050
Here comes the imperial edict!

22:15.760 --> 22:20.740
[Harmony Hall]

22:17.190 --> 22:18.560
Imperial edict to

22:19.240 --> 22:22.270
the ink merchants of Huizhou Prefecture:

22:22.400 --> 22:26.920
Recently, a group of Japanese ink artisans
led by Master Kuroda

22:27.270 --> 22:30.920
has arrived in our Great Ming,
bringing ink products of their own making,

22:30.920 --> 22:34.590
stating that they wish to admire
the excellence of our ink industry

22:34.590 --> 22:36.960
and exchange ink-making techniques.

22:37.590 --> 22:39.720
In recognition of their sincerity,

22:40.200 --> 22:44.000
I hereby grant them special permission
to participate in the Tribute Ink selection,

22:44.000 --> 22:46.070
so that they may share in
this grand occasion.

22:46.070 --> 22:48.270
The winner of this tribute selection

22:48.640 --> 22:51.960
shall receive, by imperial bestowal,
the title "Finest Ink Under Heaven",

22:51.960 --> 22:53.790
and their name shall be made known
throughout the realm.

22:53.790 --> 22:57.160
Respect this decree. Issued in August
of the first year of the Longqing Era.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.960
I respectfully obey the edict.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.030
Lord Yan,

23:05.710 --> 23:08.110
this selection is highly unusual.

23:08.960 --> 23:11.290
Hui Ink has thousands of years of history.

23:11.350 --> 23:13.550
Whether in craftsmanship or in talent,

23:13.680 --> 23:17.140
it stands among the very best
in our Great Ming's ink industry.

23:17.480 --> 23:20.200
His Majesty has high hopes for you all,

23:20.630 --> 23:23.840
so please give this selection
your utmost effort.

23:24.790 --> 23:28.350
We will certainly not
disappoint His Majesty's expectations.

23:36.030 --> 23:37.110
Here, Zhengyou,

23:37.500 --> 23:38.500
give me your bowl.

23:48.960 --> 23:50.690
My opinion remains unchanged.

23:51.440 --> 23:53.350
Our Li family has held
the tribute ink contract

23:53.350 --> 23:55.310
on an acting basis for 3 years now.

23:56.110 --> 23:59.350
If we back down at a time like this,

24:00.310 --> 24:02.310
then who can we expect

24:02.350 --> 24:03.960
to willingly

24:04.200 --> 24:06.200
represent Hui Ink in the selection?

24:06.920 --> 24:09.050
And how could Li Ink still have the face

24:09.480 --> 24:12.540
to remain the foremost
of the Hui Ink-making families?

24:13.400 --> 24:14.750
Our Sihe Ink

24:14.960 --> 24:16.420
hasn't been restored yet,

24:17.510 --> 24:20.310
and this matter concerns
His Majesty's prestige.

24:20.310 --> 24:22.110
I truly can't put my mind at ease.

24:22.790 --> 24:26.050
I'm worried what happened a decade ago
might happen again.

24:26.240 --> 24:27.170
Sister-in-law.

24:27.790 --> 24:30.250
Competing with our own people
is competing,

24:30.350 --> 24:33.210
and competing with the Japanese
is also competing.

24:33.310 --> 24:33.880
It's...

24:37.030 --> 24:39.310
Zhen, you are the head of the family.

24:39.590 --> 24:42.310
Do you agree with me?

24:43.000 --> 24:45.830
Uncle Jingdong, I understand how you feel.

24:46.550 --> 24:49.080
But I also understand
Eldest Aunt's worries.

24:49.510 --> 24:51.070
After all, it wasn't easy for our family

24:51.070 --> 24:52.790
to finally gather together.

24:53.200 --> 24:53.960
Zhen...

24:54.110 --> 24:55.030
However,

24:56.480 --> 24:57.510
given the current situation,

24:57.510 --> 24:59.240
we're at the point of no return.

25:00.200 --> 25:02.440
His Majesty has placed great hopes
in Hui Ink,

25:02.440 --> 25:04.970
and our Li family has no reason
to shrink back.

25:05.590 --> 25:07.640
Now that His Majesty has reopened
maritime trade,

25:07.640 --> 25:10.310
exchanges with foreigners
will naturally become commonplace.

25:10.310 --> 25:11.910
If foreigners can come to us,

25:12.200 --> 25:14.400
then we can go out into the world as well.

25:14.440 --> 25:16.070
For this Tribute Ink selection,

25:16.070 --> 25:18.920
Grandpa, Uncle Jingdong, and I
had already planned

25:18.920 --> 25:21.030
to restore our Sihe Ink,

25:21.350 --> 25:24.010
so as to further refine
Li Ink's craftsmanship.

25:24.160 --> 25:25.310
Furthermore, if Li Ink

25:25.310 --> 25:29.440
can use the momentum of the Tribute Ink
selection to build its reputation,

25:29.480 --> 25:32.000
and ride the wave of
the reopening of maritime trade,

25:32.000 --> 25:33.030
then perhaps

25:33.030 --> 25:36.030
our Li Ink could expand
throughout the world.

25:37.110 --> 25:39.640
By then, our business would reach
all corners of the world,

25:39.640 --> 25:41.750
and Li Ink could truly become
the Finest Ink Under Heaven.

25:41.750 --> 25:42.880
Zhen is right.

25:42.290 --> 25:46.830
[Li Zhengyou (Young)]
[Li Zhengrun (Young)]

25:43.400 --> 25:45.680
Mother, times have changed.

25:45.790 --> 25:47.790
Even the emperor has been replaced.

25:48.110 --> 25:48.920
Eighth Uncle,

25:50.000 --> 25:51.200
what's your opinion?

25:53.200 --> 25:54.660
I still hold the same view:

25:54.830 --> 25:57.760
in an ink competition,
the focus should be on the ink,

25:58.310 --> 25:59.170
not the people.

25:59.920 --> 26:01.400
As ink makers,

26:01.510 --> 26:04.770
all we can do right now
is fulfill what we are supposed to do.

26:05.110 --> 26:06.510
As for what the future holds,

26:06.510 --> 26:07.680
none of us can know.

26:09.640 --> 26:10.480
Eldest Aunt.

26:11.440 --> 26:13.550
We've all lived through
what happened back then.

26:13.550 --> 26:14.880
Compared to that,

26:15.200 --> 26:17.460
how much worse can the present really be?

26:18.880 --> 26:20.990
Zhen, I support you.

26:21.720 --> 26:22.720
I support you too.

26:23.110 --> 26:24.330
-Me too.
-Me too.

26:27.440 --> 26:29.030
If our Li Ink

26:29.510 --> 26:33.350
can win the title of
the Finest Ink Under Heaven,

26:34.550 --> 26:35.790
then I, Li Jingdong,

26:36.070 --> 26:38.130
will not have lived this life in vain.

26:38.350 --> 26:39.440
Uncle Jingdong.

26:39.640 --> 26:41.920
As long as we make the Sihe Ink well,

26:42.070 --> 26:44.110
we don't need to fear any opponent.

26:45.030 --> 26:46.310
This time, Li Ink

26:46.510 --> 26:47.750
will spare no effort

26:47.880 --> 26:50.070
to compete with all the best ink makers
in this world.

26:50.070 --> 26:50.750
Alright.

26:51.000 --> 26:53.000
Then let's have a thrilling competition.

26:53.000 --> 26:55.110
It seems our Zhengyou

26:55.160 --> 26:56.360
has great ambitions.

26:57.310 --> 26:58.110
Alright.

26:58.880 --> 27:00.350
We'll listen to Zhen

27:00.440 --> 27:02.370
and have a thrilling competition.

27:05.510 --> 27:06.040
Alright.

27:06.070 --> 27:06.480
Come on.

27:06.480 --> 27:07.720
Let's have a drink.

27:07.920 --> 27:09.180
Come on, Eighth Uncle.

27:23.250 --> 27:23.930
Zhen.

27:26.960 --> 27:27.510
Mother.

27:30.480 --> 27:31.550
Take this soup.

27:31.790 --> 27:32.720
It's still warm.

27:32.920 --> 27:35.180
Also, these are your grandpa's clothes.

27:35.350 --> 27:36.550
Bring them to him too.

27:38.600 --> 27:40.200
Grandpa has already
gone to the ink workshop?

27:40.200 --> 27:42.330
Don't you know your grandpa's temper?

27:42.810 --> 27:44.610
That old man's really stubborn.

27:44.830 --> 27:46.750
Even though during the meal just now,

27:46.750 --> 27:48.680
he didn't want to say an extra word,

27:49.200 --> 27:50.680
deep down,

27:52.100 --> 27:53.580
he wants to win this Tribute Ink selection

27:53.580 --> 27:55.130
more than anyone else.

27:57.590 --> 27:58.440
I know.

27:58.960 --> 28:00.920
Although Grandpa
has been back for 3 years,

28:00.920 --> 28:03.350
he's never let it go.

28:03.880 --> 28:06.110
His heart is still hanging on that ship

28:06.310 --> 28:08.400
that delivered ink to the capital
back then.

28:08.400 --> 28:09.640
That's even more reason

28:09.640 --> 28:11.770
for you to focus on making the ink well.

28:13.350 --> 28:14.350
Think about it.

28:15.030 --> 28:17.760
If a case from over a decade ago
can be overturned,

28:17.880 --> 28:20.270
then what can't be resolved in time?

28:20.920 --> 28:22.650
As long as we stay safe and well,

28:23.270 --> 28:25.200
we'll see that day sooner or later.

28:25.350 --> 28:26.200
Don't worry.

28:27.110 --> 28:28.440
Please go back, Mother.

28:34.510 --> 28:36.170
Look, you're coughing again.

28:36.960 --> 28:38.720
You should go back and rest.

28:39.640 --> 28:40.480
This is when

28:40.480 --> 28:42.240
the smell is the most pungent.

28:42.240 --> 28:44.440
With your condition, you can't take it.

28:45.070 --> 28:46.930
I'm here keeping an eye on things.

28:48.030 --> 28:50.030
What's there for you to worry about?

28:50.400 --> 28:51.160
Grandpa.

28:52.070 --> 28:52.870
Manager Zhen.

28:52.880 --> 28:54.160
Go back and rest.

28:54.200 --> 28:55.750
Steward Shao and I are here.

28:59.720 --> 29:00.440
Put this on.

29:01.790 --> 29:03.440
Go back to making your ink.

29:07.270 --> 29:09.670
Why are you getting
more and more stubborn?

29:20.400 --> 29:22.400
This is chicken soup my mother made.

29:22.790 --> 29:23.880
Have a few sips.

29:24.510 --> 29:25.030
Here.

30:39.350 --> 30:40.070
Ronghua?

30:40.070 --> 30:41.070
Why are you here?

30:42.070 --> 30:44.070
This is New Li Ink's account book
for this month.

30:44.070 --> 30:45.830
Check it when you have time.

30:46.550 --> 30:48.480
I trust your accounting, Ronghua.

30:48.510 --> 30:49.440
No need to check.

30:52.480 --> 30:53.110
Ronghua.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.240
I'm testing ink.

30:54.270 --> 30:55.350
Go wait for me over there.

30:55.350 --> 30:56.750
I'll be there in a moment.

31:31.270 --> 31:33.400
Why are you spacing out here, Ronghua?

31:37.350 --> 31:38.810
Is something on your mind?

31:39.510 --> 31:40.310
Zhen,

31:41.070 --> 31:43.000
after this Tribute Ink selection,

31:43.440 --> 31:44.750
I'd like to resign.

31:49.310 --> 31:51.790
The new emperor has granted
a general amnesty.

31:51.790 --> 31:53.110
Counting the days,

31:53.830 --> 31:56.480
your mother and second brother
should be returning soon.

31:56.480 --> 31:58.790
If you wish to return to the Tian family,

31:59.070 --> 32:00.240
I won't stop you.

32:03.240 --> 32:05.040
Mother already sent me a letter.

32:05.240 --> 32:07.350
She said that she and my second brother

32:07.350 --> 32:09.880
really were too ashamed to
return to Huizhou.

32:10.680 --> 32:11.590
Right now,

32:11.640 --> 32:14.500
they've settled somewhere
in Ningguo Prefecture,

32:14.920 --> 32:16.230
and she asked

32:17.310 --> 32:19.310
if I'd be willing to join them there.

32:20.440 --> 32:22.170
So what's your thought on this?

32:22.830 --> 32:24.590
With the maritme restrictions now lifted,

32:24.590 --> 32:26.790
I want to follow Cuiqiao's example

32:27.550 --> 32:29.150
and learn how to do business.

32:29.440 --> 32:30.700
I want to go see the sea,

32:31.640 --> 32:33.040
and see what's beyond it.

32:33.480 --> 32:34.440
I also want to see

32:34.680 --> 32:36.280
the other side of my own life.

32:45.240 --> 32:46.000
Okay.

32:47.110 --> 32:48.550
My ink is going to see the sea,

32:48.550 --> 32:50.590
and my Ronghua
is going to see the sea too.

32:50.590 --> 32:52.030
Then I will wait here

32:52.200 --> 32:55.000
for you to come back
and tell me about your sea.

32:57.110 --> 32:58.270
Who knows,

32:58.270 --> 33:00.350
I might even go ahead
and scout things out for you.

33:00.350 --> 33:01.160
Later,

33:01.200 --> 33:03.590
I'll have Hua'er translate
the introduction of each type of ink

33:03.590 --> 33:05.720
into European languages and teach me.

33:05.880 --> 33:08.200
That way, I can go around
telling everyone about it.

33:08.200 --> 33:09.660
That would be incredible.

33:19.480 --> 33:20.200
Zhen,

33:21.510 --> 33:23.110
after this general amnesty,

33:23.710 --> 33:25.570
have you heard any news about him?

33:30.160 --> 33:31.590
Madam Wang told me

33:31.790 --> 33:34.790
that he too has been pardoned
from his exile sentence.

33:36.070 --> 33:38.000
He has taken on the name Luo Wenqian

33:38.070 --> 33:40.240
and rejoined General Yu's ranks.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.900
The battlefield is perilous.

33:49.240 --> 33:50.900
I only wish he could stay safe.

33:56.830 --> 34:00.510
It seems a bit better this time.

34:01.680 --> 34:03.000
Give it a bit more time,

34:03.000 --> 34:05.200
and it will surely keep getting better.

34:05.440 --> 34:06.750
By my calculation,

34:06.880 --> 34:07.960
we should be able to

34:07.960 --> 34:09.190
fully restore the Sihe Ink

34:09.190 --> 34:11.120
before the Tribute Ink selection.

34:12.110 --> 34:13.320
Small discrepancies

34:13.840 --> 34:15.239
can lead to great errors.

34:16.960 --> 34:17.960
The proportions

34:19.480 --> 34:20.550
are still off.

34:21.360 --> 34:23.840
Grandpa, why don't you go back
and rest for a bit?

34:23.840 --> 34:25.280
Leave this to me and Uncle Jingdong.

34:25.280 --> 34:26.400
We'll think it over a bit more.

34:26.400 --> 34:27.199
That's right.

34:27.840 --> 34:29.480
With the Sihe Ink unfinished,

34:29.480 --> 34:30.880
how can I rest?

34:52.070 --> 34:52.760
Grandpa.

34:53.190 --> 34:54.000
Take a look.

35:06.670 --> 35:10.320
The pattern on this piece of old Sihe Ink

35:10.920 --> 35:13.650
really is different from the new ones
we've made.

35:14.710 --> 35:17.590
Perhaps the problem lies right here.

35:18.440 --> 35:20.170
This old ink piece is too small.

35:20.400 --> 35:22.460
I can't see the full pattern clearly.

35:23.880 --> 35:24.630
Zhen,

35:25.630 --> 35:28.440
go to the Ink Vault
and get that other piece of Sihe Ink

35:28.440 --> 35:30.300
so we can compare them carefully.

36:18.630 --> 36:19.470
Who's there?

36:28.550 --> 36:29.760
I'll explain it to you later.

36:29.760 --> 36:31.820
I have to go after the thief right now.

36:46.320 --> 36:47.190
Zhen.

36:48.800 --> 36:49.710
What happened?

36:49.880 --> 36:50.670
Grandpa,

36:51.630 --> 36:52.880
a thief broke into the ink workshop.

36:52.880 --> 36:53.840
Are you okay?

36:53.910 --> 36:54.420
I'm okay.

36:54.420 --> 36:55.220
Manager Zhen.

36:55.480 --> 36:56.920
Steward Shao, you came just in time.

36:56.920 --> 36:57.920
A thief broke into the ink workshop.

36:57.920 --> 36:58.630
He ran that way.

36:58.630 --> 36:59.000
Hurry

36:59.030 --> 37:00.280
-and look around.
-Hurry. Alright.

37:00.280 --> 37:00.760
Got it.

37:00.760 --> 37:01.800
He ran that way.

37:03.710 --> 37:05.170
Uncle Jingdong. Grandpa.

37:05.870 --> 37:06.710
Just now, I...

37:11.110 --> 37:12.230
Luo Wenqian?

37:20.880 --> 37:21.880
Eighth Master Li.

37:22.800 --> 37:23.730
Uncle Jingdong.

37:25.040 --> 37:25.840
Steward Shao.

37:31.510 --> 37:32.710
Why are you here?

37:35.360 --> 37:36.510
It's a long story.

37:36.550 --> 37:37.480
Give me a second.

37:43.150 --> 37:45.440
This is a hidden weapon
used by the Japanese.

37:45.440 --> 37:48.230
The group led by Kuroda this time
is made up of people with mixed backgrounds.

37:48.230 --> 37:50.890
General Yu ordered me to
monitor them secretly.

37:51.320 --> 37:52.720
Over the past few months,

37:52.760 --> 37:53.840
they've always been moving as a group.

37:53.840 --> 37:54.760
Until half a month ago,

37:54.760 --> 37:56.710
one of them quietly broke away
from the group.

37:56.710 --> 37:58.440
I followed him all the way—

37:58.630 --> 37:59.550
from Nanjing

38:00.030 --> 38:01.030
to Wuyuan,

38:01.280 --> 38:02.110
then to Xiuning,

38:02.110 --> 38:03.570
and finally to She County.

38:04.550 --> 38:05.920
This person had no other agenda

38:05.920 --> 38:08.000
than visit various ink-making families

38:08.000 --> 38:09.920
to gather intelligence
about ink workshops.

38:09.920 --> 38:11.630
In order not to alert him,

38:12.070 --> 38:13.590
I didn't make a move against him,

38:13.590 --> 38:14.480
because I wanted to figure out

38:14.480 --> 38:16.010
what his ultimate goal was.

38:17.110 --> 38:17.960
However,

38:18.480 --> 38:20.880
he just attempted to kill you,
so I had to...

38:21.400 --> 38:22.260
Reveal myself.

38:24.920 --> 38:28.000
It seems that person means no good.

38:28.190 --> 38:28.920
Exactly.

38:39.280 --> 38:41.960
Her Highness Princess Shouyang
has arrived!

38:47.540 --> 38:50.830
Greetings, Your Highness!

38:53.960 --> 38:54.840
You may rise.

38:55.400 --> 38:57.480
Thank you, Your Highness.

39:18.320 --> 39:20.630
In this Tribute Ink selection,

39:20.960 --> 39:24.710
His Majesty has specially permitted
the Kuroda family from Japan

39:24.880 --> 39:26.720
to participate by bringing their ink
and exchange ink-making techniques.

39:26.720 --> 39:28.720
I've been entrusted by His Majesty

39:28.760 --> 39:30.490
to oversee this matter.

39:31.400 --> 39:33.630
You must all devote yourselves fully

39:33.840 --> 39:35.700
and not fail His Majesty's grace.

39:35.880 --> 39:40.210
All of us in the Huizhou ink industry
will certainly give it our utmost effort.

39:40.480 --> 39:43.480
The Kuroda family of Japan
seeks an audience!

39:55.800 --> 39:57.630
Greetings, Your Highness.

39:57.920 --> 39:58.760
Please rise.

40:00.840 --> 40:01.880
Your Highness.

40:02.590 --> 40:05.440
Your esteemed country
truly lives up to its reputation

40:05.440 --> 40:07.630
as a great and superior state,
a land of profound cultural heritage.

40:07.630 --> 40:09.760
What we've seen and experienced
along the way

40:09.760 --> 40:13.000
is more than enough to deeply
convince us of its greatness.

40:13.000 --> 40:15.030
Even the city of Huizhou today

40:15.190 --> 40:17.630
presents itself with
a solemn and dignified presence.

40:15.790 --> 40:17.680
[Head of the Kuroda Family,
Kuroda Ichiro]

40:18.030 --> 40:21.400
It's truly a place blessed with
outstanding natural beauty

40:21.440 --> 40:24.030
and a thousand-year legacy of ink-making.

40:25.280 --> 40:26.590
Thank you for your kind words.

40:26.590 --> 40:27.670
Your Highness.

40:28.150 --> 40:31.510
We've long heard that Hui Ink
leads the ink industry in this world.

40:31.510 --> 40:32.880
Since this is our first visit
to your esteemed land,

40:32.090 --> 40:34.400
[Master Ink Maker of the Kuroda Family,
Renkichi Eisho]

40:32.910 --> 40:34.840
we did not dare come empty-handed.

40:35.550 --> 40:36.880
In this box

40:37.590 --> 40:40.070
are ink products
made by our Kuroda family,

40:40.800 --> 40:44.510
which we'd like to present as gifts
to various ink workshops in Huizhou.

40:44.510 --> 40:47.440
We respectfully request
Your Highness's approval.

40:49.070 --> 40:50.070
Bring it forward.

41:05.710 --> 41:08.440
President Hu, we humbly request
your guidance.

41:12.880 --> 41:15.190
We've long heard that the Chen family
has been renowned for a century

41:15.190 --> 41:18.590
for its Cloud Ink and Scholar Ink.

41:19.480 --> 41:21.070
This is the ink our Kuroda family
has produced

41:21.070 --> 41:24.400
based on those 2 types of ink
as reference.

41:24.840 --> 41:27.960
We respectfully ask for your guidance,
Manager Chen.

41:34.100 --> 41:35.550
[Scholar Ink]

41:49.150 --> 41:49.760
Father.

41:51.510 --> 41:52.970
How is this even possible?

41:55.360 --> 41:57.480
Li Ink originates from
the Southern Tang dynasty

41:57.480 --> 42:00.070
and is regarded as the foremost
of the ink industry in the Great Ming.

42:00.070 --> 42:01.280
Even in Japan,

42:01.400 --> 42:03.190
Li Ink is widely known to all.

42:04.760 --> 42:06.590
The gift we present to Li Ink

42:06.750 --> 42:09.150
also traces its origins
back to the Southern Tang dynasty.

42:09.150 --> 42:11.410
Please offer your guidance, Manager Li.

42:18.350 --> 42:21.410
[Sihe Ink]

42:22.960 --> 42:24.070
Manager Li,

42:24.920 --> 42:26.510
do you recognize this ink?

42:36.230 --> 42:38.090
It's the Sihe Ink of the Li family.

42:44.400 --> 42:45.920
Now that the gifts have been delivered,

42:45.920 --> 42:46.960
I just wonder—

42:47.230 --> 42:48.960
in this Tribute Ink selection,

42:49.070 --> 42:51.670
which types of ink will you all use

42:52.230 --> 42:54.690
to compete against
our Kuroda family's ink?

42:56.590 --> 42:57.630
Renkichi.

42:58.750 --> 42:59.860
Don't be rude.
